| 3-model | 0.50 | 400 | 0.9149 | 0.0476 | **0.9374** |
| 3-model | 0.60 | 400 | 0.9117 | 0.0465 | 0.9368 |
Note this uses a single global threshold and still-in-progress b4. Observations:
